[budget] := minimize(30m * calls + 1h * visits) = 200m · calls 0 · visits 3.3333
| constraint | expression               |
| ---------- | ------------------------ |
| coverage   | calls + 3 * visits >= 10 | 10 ≥ 10 · ● binding

